# The image build context, as an allowlist.
#
# The build needs three files. The repository is 135 MB larger than that, mostly the
# reference clone, and a build context is uploaded before anything in it is read — so a
# denylist that forgets one directory pays for it on every rebuild.
#
# Excluding everything first and naming what is needed also keeps the image honest about
# its inputs: nothing can be baked in by accident, so the code genuinely arrives with the
# job snapshot rather than sometimes with the image.
*

!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!azure/docker/Dockerfile
